  "term": "Ptolemaic theory",
  "definition": "Ptolemaic theory is the view of the world system presented by Ptolemy in his Syntaxis. It holds that the earth is a globe fixed at the center of the world, while the heavens revolve daily around an axis passing through the earth’s center.",
